# {{AREA}} requirements

Each requirement carries a stable ID of the form `REQ-{{AREA}}-NNN`. The ID appears
in the code that implements it and in the name of every test that verifies it.
`trace_matrix.py` builds the traceability matrix from those tags and fails on any
requirement with no test.

IDs are never reused and never renumbered. Retire one by marking it obsolete here.

